      "rev_n_5_e37d4e_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_5_e37d4e_1",
        "node_id": "n_5_e37d4e",
        "thought_text": "The error in the code is due to the loop condition. It should continue until we can't build the next level, which means the condition should be `cubes_used + (level + 1) <= n` instead of `cubes_used + (level + 1) <= n`. This ensures we stop when we don't have enough cubes for the next level.",
